 44 assault rifle and the jet aircraft, but they came too late to have a decisive impact. An example of a failed new “superweapon” that was rushed to production was the Panzer VIII Maus, a 188 tonne steel monster with a top speed of 3 km/h. It was considered to be a useless mountain of steel that drained material and resources that could be used to produce many working tanks.","LocalizedString":"As the situation worsened for Germany in WWII, new weapon designs were often rushed into production which often led to poor and disappointing results on the battlefield. There were a few examples of successful new weapons that were rushed to production, such as the V-2 rocket, the StG 44 assault rifle and the jet aircraft, but they came too late to have a decisive impact. An example of a failed new “superweapon” that was rushed to production was the Panzer VIII Maus, a 188 tonne steel monster with a top speed of 3 km/h. It was considered to be a useless mountain of steel that drained material and resources that could be used to produce many working tanks."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isReserved":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnEndOfTurn"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/t_pointing_soldier.t_pointing_soldier","SubPathString":""},"artist":"War posters / Alamy Stock Photo","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/RUSH_PRODUCTION.RUSH_PRODUCTION","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":669.0},"historyPhotoSource":"German Federal Archive","historyPhotoIdentificationCode":"141-1880","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_event_rush_production_photo","SourceString":"Launching of a V-2 rocket, 19